  {
    "RowId": 2864,
    "Description": "Deploys a single-target battle turret which attacks using \u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #ff7b1a;\u0022\u003EVolley Fire\u003C/span\u003E, dealing damage with a potency of 35.\nPotency increases as \u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #ff7b1a;\u0022\u003EBattery Gauge\u003C/span\u003E exceeds required cost at time of deployment, up to a maximum of 75.\n\u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #00cc22;\u0022\u003EBattery Gauge Cost: \u003C/span\u003E50\n\u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #00cc22;\u0022\u003EDuration: \u003C/span\u003E9s\nConsumes \u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #ff7b1a;\u0022\u003EBattery Gauge\u003C/span\u003E upon execution.\nShuts down when time expires or upon execution of \u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #ff7b1a;\u0022\u003ERook Overdrive\u003C/span\u003E.\nShares a recast timer with \u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #ff7b1a;\u0022\u003ERook Overdrive\u003C/span\u003E."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 2865,
    "Description": "Deploys an area of effect battle turret which will deliver auto-attacks to enemies within range with a potency of 60 for the first enemy, 10% less for the second, 20% less for the third, 30% less for the fourth, 40% less for the fifth, and 50% less for all remaining enemies.\u003CIf([gnum72\u003E=30])\u003E\u003Cif([gnum68==31],\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Ccolortype(504)\u003E\u003Cedgecolortype(505)\u003EHypercharge Potency:\u003Cedgecolortype(0)\u003E\u003Ccolortype(0)\u003E 90\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Ccolortype(504)\u003E\u003Cedgecolortype(505)\u003EHypercharge Effect:\u003Cedgecolortype(0)\u003E\u003Ccolortype(0)\u003E Increases target\u0027s damage taken by 5%\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Ccolortype(504)\u003E\u003Cedgecolortype(505)\u003EDuration:\u003Cedgecolortype(0)\u003E\u003Ccolortype(0)\u003E 10s,)\u003E\u003CElse/\u003E \u003C/If\u003E\nShares a recast timer with \u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #ff7b1a;\u0022\u003ERook Autoturret\u003C/span\u003E."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 2866,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 140.\u003CIf([gnum68==31])\u003E\u003Cif([gnum72\u003E=30],\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Ccolortype(504)\u003E\u003Cedgecolortype(505)\u003EAdditional Effect:\u003Cedgecolortype(0)\u003E\u003Ccolortype(0)\u003E Increases \u003Ccolortype(500)\u003E\u003Cedgecolortype(501)\u003EHeat Gauge\u003Cedgecolortype(0)\u003E\u003Ccolortype(0)\u003E by 5,)\u003E\u003CElse/\u003E \u003C/If\u003E"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 2867,
    "Description": "Loads firearm with three rounds of special ammunition. One round of ammunition is used each time a weaponskill is executed, increasing that weaponskill\u0027s potency. Ammunition use may also increase the rate at which a weaponskill\u0027s additional effect is triggered\u003CIf([gnum72\u003E=52])\u003E\u003Cif([gnum68==31],\\, as well as lower the accompanying \u003Ccolortype(500)\u003E\u003Cedgecolortype(501)\u003EHeat Gauge\u003Cedgecolortype(0)\u003E\u003Ccolortype(0)\u003E increase.,.)\u003E\u003CElse/\u003E.\u003C/If\u003E No more than three rounds can be loaded at one time."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 2868,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 100.\n\u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #00cc22;\u0022\u003ECombo Action: \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #ff7b1a;\u0022\u003ESplit Shot\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #ff7b1a;\u0022\u003EHeated Split Shot\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #00cc22;\u0022\u003ECombo Potency: \u003C/span\u003E210\u003CIf([gnum68==31])\u003E\u003Cif([gnum72\u003E=30],\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Ccolortype(504)\u003E\u003Cedgecolortype(505)\u003ECombo Bonus:\u003Cedgecolortype(0)\u003E\u003Ccolortype(0)\u003E Increases \u003Ccolortype(500)\u003E\u003Cedgecolortype(501)\u003EHeat Gauge\u003Cedgecolortype(0)\u003E\u003Ccolortype(0)\u003E by 5,)\u003E\u003CElse/\u003E \u003C/If\u003E"
  },
  {
