    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 40.\n\u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #00cc22;\u0022\u003EAdditional Effect:\u003C/span\u003E Damage over time\n\u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #00cc22;\u0022\u003EPotency:\u003C/span\u003E 45\n\u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #00cc22;\u0022\u003EDuration:\u003C/span\u003E \u003CIf([gnum72\u003E=14])\u003E\u003Cif([gnum68==31],30,18)\u003E\u003CElse/\u003E18\u003C/If\u003Es"
