    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 130.\n\u003Cspan style=\u0022color: #00cc22;\u0022\u003EMaximum Charges: \u003C/span\u003E\u003CIf([gnum68==31])\u003E\u003Cif([gnum72\u003E=74],3,2)\u003E\u003CElse/\u003E2\u003C/If\u003E"
